WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.520
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where were you at <b>seven o’clock yesterday morning</b>?

00:00:07.598 --> 00:00:08.712
<v><b>B:</b></v> I was at <b>home</b>.

00:00:10.784 --> 00:00:11.905
<v><b>A:</b></v> Were you in <b>bed</b>?

00:00:14.462 --> 00:00:15.761
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Yes</b>, I <b>was</b>.

00:00:18.331 --> 00:00:19.942
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Where</b> were you at <b>ten o’clock</b>?

00:00:23.535 --> 00:00:25.576
<v><b>B:</b></v> I was in a <b>café</b> with <b>friends</b>.

00:00:30.161 --> 00:00:31.647
<v><b>A:</b></v> Were you <b>there</b> all <b>morning</b>?

00:00:35.722 --> 00:00:39.000
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>No</b>, we <b>weren’t</b>. We were <b>there</b> for an <b>hour</b>.